44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the scope freeze failing is the real danger. We need a vendor whose rules survive contact with reality, not one that demands a perfect, static environment.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
